{"id":"f917b5f20ec04176","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection.md","title":"所有输入上全策略选择的不可能性","display":"thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection — 所有输入上全策略选择的不可能性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection","aliases":["20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection"],"display":"thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection — 所有输入上全策略选择的不可能性","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 15.1.2(iv) 加入全策略输出条件后的订正","source_printed_pages":[218],"source_pdf_pages":[247],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-recursion]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection — 所有输入上全策略选择的不可能性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 15.1.2(iv) 加入全策略输出条件后的订正"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>247</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_k=\\{\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\varphi_k(\\operatorname{code}(\\rho))\\downarrow=1\\}\">\\(S_k=\\{\\rho\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\varphi_k(\\operatorname{code}(\\rho))\\downarrow=1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_k}[\\rho]\">\\(A_k=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_k}[\\rho]\\)</span>。合法特征指标条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\">\\(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_I=\\bigcup_n2^{2n}\">\\(H_I=\\bigcup_n2^{2n}\\)</span> 为 I 的历史域；记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\varphi_j(h)\\simeq\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(h))\">\\(\\widehat\\varphi_j(h)\\simeq\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(h))\\)</span>，作为部分策略程序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为全可计算一元函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no-total-open-strategy-selection}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall k\\ \\left(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\Rightarrow\n\\forall h\\in H_I\\ \\exists b\\in2\\ [\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)}(h)\\downarrow=b]\\right),\\\\\n\\forall k\\ \\left((\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\land\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A_k))\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_I(\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)},A_k)\\right)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no-total-open-strategy-selection}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall k\\ \\left(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\Rightarrow\n\\forall h\\in H_I\\ \\exists b\\in2\\ [\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)}(h)\\downarrow=b]\\right),\\\\\n\\forall k\\ \\left((\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\land\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A_k))\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_I(\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)},A_k)\\right)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>假设有选择器。由递归定理取得特征函数指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，其对串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 的判定程序模拟“先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(k)\">\\(\\psi(k)\\)</span>，再运行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\psi(k)}(\\varnothing)\">\\(\\varphi_{\\psi(k)}(\\varnothing)\\)</span>”至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\rho|\">\\(|\\rho|\\)</span> 步；若其已输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in2\">\\(b\\in2\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\rho|&gt;0\">\\(|\\rho|&gt;0\\)</span>，当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(0)=1-b\">\\(\\rho(0)=1-b\\)</span> 时输出 1，否则输出 0。这是有界模拟，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_k\">\\(\\varphi_k\\)</span> 无条件是全特征函数，合法性不依赖候选策略是否停止。</p>\n<p>全策略输出条件使空历史的计算终于输出某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=[1-b]\">\\(A_k=[1-b]\\)</span>：充分长的所有以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-b\">\\(1-b\\)</span> 起始串被接纳，其他串不被接纳。I 显然有全可计算胜策，首步选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-b\">\\(1-b\\)</span>；但候选首步选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>，此后任何行动都不会进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k\">\\(A_k\\)</span>，矛盾。关键用的是所有合法输入都输出全策略，不能删除这个前提后仍套用反证。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 218 / PDF 247；全定义性条件与证明均为本地订正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S_k=\\{\\rho\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\varphi_k(\\operatorname{code}(\\rho))\\downarrow=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A_k=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S_k}[\\rho]","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}","display":false},{"tex":"H_I=\\bigcup_n2^{2n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\varphi_j(h)\\simeq\\varphi_j(\\operatorname{code}(h))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no-total-open-strategy-selection}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall k\\ \\left(\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\Rightarrow\n\\forall h\\in H_I\\ \\exists b\\in2\\ [\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)}(h)\\downarrow=b]\\right),\\\\\n\\forall k\\ \\left((\\varphi_k=\\chi_{\\operatorname{code}[S_k]}\\land\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A_k))\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Win}_I(\\widehat\\varphi_{\\psi(k)},A_k)\\right)\n\\end{gathered}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{\\psi(k)}(\\varnothing)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\rho|","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in2","display":false},{"tex":"|\\rho|>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(0)=1-b","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_k","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"A_k=[1-b]","display":false},{"tex":"1-b","display":false},{"tex":"1-b","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"A_k","display":false}],"bytes":2794,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd307d59aba6545f","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这一编译结论不保证 I 败的输入上输出程序全定义。因此，按本目录通常的“指标→程序”语义，原书 Exercise 15.1.2(iv) 的字面否定与该显式编译冲突；其可成立的更强条件是要求所有有效输入都产生全策略，包括 I 败的游戏，见 [[20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection]]。两种量词条件分开列出，不以“非统一”一词替代精确接口。此订正是本地证明结论，未冒称原书已经给出。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"既有路线可继续阅读：动态枚举 [[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]；反演与精确对 [[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]、[[20-thm-exact-pair]]；有限损伤 [[20-thm-low-simple]]、[[20-thm-fm]]、[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；Δ₂ 扩展 [[20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance]]、[[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]；基定理 [[20-thm-low-basis]]、[[20-thm-superlow-basis]]；博弈 [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]、[[20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler]]、[[20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection]]。"}],"outgoing":["416559051d6f8f46","8ba6597a854c206f","f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","dc642dd12c05d028","755e421576224435","e343870c773cb68e"]}